
# ---------------- dreams ----------------
@rule small.dreams.odd~state
on small
when subject=dreams
shape state
hook dreams_odd
opens ask,share,tease
- I had the strangest dream last night. I was late for an exam in a school with no doors.
- I dreamed I could fly, but only about this high off the ground. Very useless.
- Last night I dreamed the cafeteria ran out of everything. I woke up hungry.

@rule small.dreams.tired~state
on small
when subject=dreams mood=sleepy
shape state
hook dreams_odd
opens ask,share,tease
- I barely slept. Every time I closed my eyes I dreamed I was still awake. It's exhausting.
- My dreams were so busy I'm more tired now than before bed.

@rule small.dreams.you~state
on small
when subject=dreams interest=yes rel!=stranger
shape state
hook dreams_you
opens ask,tease,admit
- ...You were in my dream last night. Don't ask me what we were doing.
- I dreamed about you. It was a normal dream! Mostly.

@rule me.h.dreams_odd
on me.small
when hook=dreams_odd
- Do you remember your dreams?
- Have any weird dreams lately?

@rule move.h.dreams_odd.ask
on move.ask
when hook=dreams_odd
- Ask how the dream ended

@rule react.h.dreams_odd.ask
on react
when hook=dreams_odd move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I woke up right before the end. I always do.
- It ended with me eating the exam paper. Don't analyze that.
- I found a door. It led to my bedroom. Then the alarm rang.

@rule move.h.dreams_odd.share
on move.share
when hook=dreams_odd
- Tell her one of your strange dreams

@rule react.h.dreams_odd.share
on react
when hook=dreams_odd move=share fit=good|neutral
- Yours is weirder than mine. I feel better now.
- Okay, that one wins. That's a prize-winning dream.
- Wait, I think I've had that one too!

@rule move.h.dreams_odd.tease
on move.tease
when hook=dreams_odd
- Say it means she ate too much before bed

@rule react.h.dreams_odd.tease
on react
when hook=dreams_odd move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Rude. ...Accurate, but rude.
- I had one rice ball! Okay, two.
- Then my dreams are your fault for talking about food.

@rule react.h.dreams_odd.bad
on react
when hook=dreams_odd fit=bad
feel pout
- It sounded funnier in my head.
- Never mind. Dreams are boring to hear about.

@rule me.h.dreams_you
on me.small
when hook=dreams_you
- Did you sleep well?
- Any good dreams last night?

@rule move.h.dreams_you.ask
on move.ask
when hook=dreams_you
- Ask what you were doing in it

@rule react.h.dreams_you.ask
on react
when hook=dreams_you move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Walking. Somewhere with lanterns. That's all you're getting.
- You were holding an umbrella over me. It wasn't even raining.
- ...Nothing weird! You were just there. Near me.

@rule move.h.dreams_you.tease
on move.tease
when hook=dreams_you
- Ask if you were a good dream or a bad one

@rule react.h.dreams_you.tease
on react
when hook=dreams_you move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Good. Obviously. Don't make that face.
- A good one. Annoyingly good.
- Ask me again and it'll be a nightmare.

@rule move.h.dreams_you.admit
on move.admit
when hook=dreams_you
- Admit she has been in yours too

@rule react.h.dreams_you.admit
on react
when hook=dreams_you move=admit fit=good|neutral
- ...Really? Then we're even.
- Ah... okay. That's... okay. My face is hot.
- Then let's not tell each other the details. Deal?

@rule react.h.dreams_you.bad
on react
when hook=dreams_you fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. It was just a dream.
- Why did I tell you that...

# ---------------- family ----------------
@rule small.family.normal~state
on small
when subject=family
shape state
hook family_home
opens ask,share,tease
- My family's pretty normal. Loud at dinner, quiet in the morning.
- My mom texts me every day to ask if I ate. Every single day.
- My dad tells the same three jokes. We laugh every time anyway.

@rule small.family.evening~state
on small
when subject=family period=after
shape state
hook family_home
opens ask,share,tease
- I should get home soon. My mom gets worried if dinner goes cold.
- It's my turn to cook dinner tonight. My family is very brave.

@rule small.family.ask~state
on small
when subject=family rel=girlfriend|lover
shape state
hook family_you
opens ask,tease,agree
- My mom asked about you. I may have said too much.
- My little sister found your photo on my phone. She has questions.

@rule me.h.family_home
on me.small
when hook=family_home
- How's your family?
- What's your family like?

@rule move.h.family_home.ask
on move.ask
when hook=family_home
- Ask who she gets along with best

@rule react.h.family_home.ask
on react
when hook=family_home move=ask fit=good|neutral
- My grandma. She sneaks me snacks and takes my side.
- My mom, mostly. We fight like sisters, though.
- My dad. We watch bad movies together and say nothing.

@rule move.h.family_home.share
on move.share
when hook=family_home
- Tell her about your own family

@rule react.h.family_home.share
on react
when hook=family_home move=share fit=good|neutral
- Your family sounds fun. I'd like to meet them someday.
- So everyone's family is a little weird. Good.
- Ha, your dad and mine would get along.

@rule move.h.family_home.tease
on move.tease
when hook=family_home
- Say she sounds spoiled

@rule react.h.family_home.tease
on react
when hook=family_home move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I am not! ...Maybe a little.
- Spoiled with love. That's different.
- Says you. I bet you still get your lunch made.

@rule react.h.family_home.bad
on react
when hook=family_home fit=bad
feel pout
- Let's not talk about my family.
- It's complicated. Another time.

@rule me.h.family_you
on me.small
when hook=family_you
- Does your family know about us?
- What did your family say?

@rule move.h.family_you.ask
on move.ask
when hook=family_you
- Ask what she told them

@rule react.h.family_you.ask
on react
when hook=family_you move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That you're kind. And that you're mine. Mostly the second part.
- Only good things. I edited a little.
- That you walk me home. My mom liked that.

@rule move.h.family_you.tease
on move.tease
when hook=family_you
- Ask if they approve of you

@rule react.h.family_you.tease
on react
when hook=family_you move=tease fit=good|neutral
- They want to meet you first. Be scared.
- My dad hasn't decided. He's polishing his glare.
- My mom approves. My sister wants proof you're real.

@rule move.h.family_you.agree
on move.agree
when hook=family_you
- Say you would like to meet them

@rule react.h.family_you.agree
on react
when hook=family_you move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then wear something nice. Not that.
- Okay... I'll ask. Don't back out.
- You say that now. Wait until my dad asks about your grades.

@rule react.h.family_you.bad
on react
when hook=family_you fit=bad
feel pout
- Never mind. I shouldn't have said anything.
- Let's keep it between us for now.

# ---------------- hometown ----------------
@rule small.hometown.small~state
on small
when subject=hometown
shape state
hook hometown_home
opens ask,share,invite
- I grew up near the sea. I still can't sleep without some noise.
- Where I grew up, the convenience store closed at nine. Nine!
- My hometown has one famous thing: a very large radish festival.

@rule small.hometown.rain~state
on small
when subject=hometown wet=yes
shape state
hook hometown_home
opens ask,share,invite
- Rain like this reminds me of home. It rained all summer there.
- Back home, a day like this meant no school. Here it just means wet socks.

@rule small.hometown.miss~state
on small
when subject=hometown mood=lonely|upset
shape state
hook hometown_miss
opens ask,comfort,share
- Sometimes I miss my hometown. Everyone knew my name there.
- I called home last night. It made me miss it more.

@rule me.h.hometown_home
on me.small
when hook=hometown_home
- Where did you grow up?
- Are you from around here?

@rule move.h.hometown_home.ask
on move.ask
when hook=hometown_home
- Ask what she misses most about it

@rule react.h.hometown_home.ask
on react
when hook=hometown_home move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The food stalls by the station. Nothing here tastes the same.
- The quiet. You can hear the trains from far away.
- My old friends. And the cat that lived at the shrine.

@rule move.h.hometown_home.share
on move.share
when hook=hometown_home
- Tell her where you grew up

@rule react.h.hometown_home.share
on react
when hook=hometown_home move=share fit=good|neutral
- That sounds nice. Busier than mine, at least.
- We should trade hometowns for a week.
- So you're a city kid. I could tell.

@rule move.h.hometown_home.invite
on move.invite
when hook=hometown_home
- Say she should show you around it someday

@rule react.h.hometown_home.invite
on react
when hook=hometown_home move=invite fit=good|neutral
- You'd be bored in an hour. ...But okay.
- Only if you try the local snack. It's an acquired taste.
- Really? Then I'll be your guide. A strict one.

@rule react.h.hometown_home.bad
on react
when hook=hometown_home fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not that interesting.
- There's not much to say about it.

@rule me.h.hometown_miss
on me.small
when hook=hometown_miss
- Do you miss home?
- Do you ever go back home?

@rule move.h.hometown_miss.ask
on move.ask
when hook=hometown_miss
- Ask when she last went back

@rule react.h.hometown_miss.ask
on react
when hook=hometown_miss move=ask fit=good|neutral
- New Year's. It feels like years ago.
- Last summer. My room was turned into storage.
- Too long. I keep saying next month.

@rule move.h.hometown_miss.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=hometown_miss
- Say she's got people here too now

@rule react.h.hometown_miss.comfort
on react
when hook=hometown_miss move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...Yeah. I guess I do. You're one of them.
- That helps more than you think.
- Thanks. Here's starting to feel like home a little.

@rule move.h.hometown_miss.share
on move.share
when hook=hometown_miss
- Say you get homesick too

@rule react.h.hometown_miss.share
on react
when hook=hometown_miss move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? You don't look like it.
- Then we can be homesick together.
- That's comforting. In a sad way.

@rule react.h.hometown_miss.bad
on react
when hook=hometown_miss fit=bad
feel pout
- I'm fine. Forget I said that.
- Let's talk about something else.

# ---------------- childhood ----------------
@rule small.childhood.kid~state
on small
when subject=childhood
shape state
hook childhood_kid
opens ask,share,tease
- When I was little I wanted to be a bus driver. I liked the buttons.
- As a kid I hid in the closet at every family party. Every one.
- I used to collect rocks. I named all of them. I still have three.

@rule small.childhood.energetic~state
on small
when subject=childhood energy>=0.7
shape state
hook childhood_kid
opens ask,share,tease
- I was a terror as a kid. I climbed everything. Trees, fences, my dad.
- I broke my arm twice before I was ten. Both times showing off.

@rule small.childhood.shy~state
on small
when subject=childhood shy>=0.6
shape state
hook childhood_shy
opens ask,comfort,share
- I was so shy as a kid I'd whisper my answers to the teacher. I'm better now. A little.
- I didn't talk to anyone in my class until third grade.

@rule me.h.childhood_kid
on me.small
when hook=childhood_kid
- What were you like as a kid?
- Were you a good kid?

@rule move.h.childhood_kid.ask
on move.ask
when hook=childhood_kid
- Ask what she wanted to be back then

@rule react.h.childhood_kid.ask
on react
when hook=childhood_kid move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A princess, then a vet, then a ninja. In that order.
- An astronaut. Then I learned about the math.
- A baker. I still might.

@rule move.h.childhood_kid.share
on move.share
when hook=childhood_kid
- Tell her something embarrassing from your childhood

@rule react.h.childhood_kid.share
on react
when hook=childhood_kid move=share fit=good|neutral
- No way. I'm never forgetting that.
- That's adorable. I'm telling everyone.
- Okay, that's worse than mine. Thank you.

@rule move.h.childhood_kid.tease
on move.tease
when hook=childhood_kid
- Say she hasn't changed at all

@rule react.h.childhood_kid.tease
on react
when hook=childhood_kid move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Hey! ...I'll take that as a compliment.
- I've grown! A little. Upward.
- You didn't even know me then!

@rule react.h.childhood_kid.bad
on react
when hook=childhood_kid fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't remember much.
- That's enough about me as a kid.

@rule me.h.childhood_shy
on me.small
when hook=childhood_shy
- Were you always this quiet?
- What were you like in grade school?

@rule move.h.childhood_shy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=childhood_shy
- Ask who her first friend was

@rule react.h.childhood_shy.ask
on react
when hook=childhood_shy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A girl who shared her crayons without asking. She just slid them over.
- The class rabbit. Then the girl who fed it with me.
- My neighbor. She did all the talking for both of us.

@rule move.h.childhood_shy.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=childhood_shy
- Say she talks to you just fine

@rule react.h.childhood_shy.comfort
on react
when hook=childhood_shy move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...That's because you're easy to talk to.
- I do, don't I? I didn't notice.
- Don't point it out, or I'll get shy again.

@rule move.h.childhood_shy.share
on move.share
when hook=childhood_shy
- Say you were shy too, once

@rule react.h.childhood_shy.share
on react
when hook=childhood_shy move=share fit=good|neutral
- You? I don't believe it.
- Then we would've been quiet together.
- What changed? ...Teach me.

@rule react.h.childhood_shy.bad
on react
when hook=childhood_shy fit=bad
feel pout
- I'd rather not remember.
- It's in the past.

# ---------------- movies ----------------
@rule small.movies.seen~state
on small
when subject=movies
shape state
hook movies_seen
opens ask,share,invite
- I watched a horror movie last night. Bad idea. I slept with the light on.
- I cried at an animated movie about a lost umbrella. It was very sad.
- I fell asleep during the action movie everyone loves. Twice.

@rule small.movies.date~state
on small
when subject=movies interest=yes
shape state
hook movies_seen
opens ask,share,invite
- There's a new movie out. It'd be more fun to see with someone.
- I keep waiting for someone to ask me to the movies. Hint, hint.

@rule small.movies.rain~state
on small
when subject=movies weather=rain|storm
shape state
hook movies_seen
opens ask,share,invite
- Weather like this is made for staying in with a movie and a blanket.
- On rainy days I watch old movies. They feel cozier.

@rule me.h.movies_seen
on me.small
when hook=movies_seen
- Seen any good movies?
- What kind of movies do you like?

@rule move.h.movies_seen.ask
on move.ask
when hook=movies_seen
- Ask what she likes to watch

@rule react.h.movies_seen.ask
on react
when hook=movies_seen move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Mysteries. I like guessing the ending before anyone.
- Anything with animals. If the dog dies, I leave.
- Romance. Don't laugh. ...You're laughing.

@rule move.h.movies_seen.share
on move.share
when hook=movies_seen
- Tell her the last movie you saw

@rule react.h.movies_seen.share
on react
when hook=movies_seen move=share fit=good|neutral
- I wanted to see that one! Was it good?
- You liked that? We need to talk.
- Okay, now I want to see it.

@rule move.h.movies_seen.invite
on move.invite
when hook=movies_seen
- Ask if she wants to see one together

@rule react.h.movies_seen.invite
on react
when hook=movies_seen move=invite fit=good|neutral
- ...Are you asking me out? Fine. Yes.
- Only if you buy the popcorn.
- Okay. But I pick the movie.

@rule react.h.movies_seen.bad
on react
when hook=movies_seen fit=bad
feel pout
- Never mind. I'm picky.
- We clearly have different taste.

# ---------------- games ----------------
@rule small.games.play~state
on small
when subject=games
shape state
hook games_play
opens ask,share,tease
- I stayed up playing a game last night. I lost every round and kept going.
- My little brother beat me at a racing game. I'm demanding a rematch.
- I'm stuck on a puzzle game. It's been three days. It's personal now.

@rule small.games.cool~state
on small
when subject=games tone=cool|proper
shape state
hook games_play
opens ask,share,tease
- I don't play games much. Chess, sometimes. I win.
- Board games only. I like seeing the other person lose.

@rule small.games.arcade~state
on small
when subject=games period=after rel!=stranger
shape state
hook games_arcade
opens ask,invite,tease
- There's an arcade near the station. I'm unbeatable at the claw machine.
- I want to go to the arcade after school. I've been practicing a rhythm game.

@rule me.h.games_play
on me.small
when hook=games_play
- Do you play any games?
- Into video games at all?

@rule move.h.games_play.ask
on move.ask
when hook=games_play
- Ask what game it was

@rule react.h.games_play.ask
on react
when hook=games_play move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A cute farming game. I'm a terrible farmer.
- A fighting game. I just press everything.
- One with puzzles and a cat. The cat judges me.

@rule move.h.games_play.share
on move.share
when hook=games_play
- Say you play too

@rule react.h.games_play.share
on react
when hook=games_play move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then we're playing together. No mercy.
- What do you play? If you say the boring one, I'll leave.
- Finally, someone normal.

@rule move.h.games_play.tease
on move.tease
when hook=games_play
- Say you could beat her easily

@rule react.h.games_play.tease
on react
when hook=games_play move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Oh? Say that to me with a controller in your hand.
- Big words. Prove it.
- You're on. Loser buys juice.

@rule react.h.games_play.bad
on react
when hook=games_play fit=bad
feel pout
- You wouldn't get it.
- It's not that kind of game. Never mind.

@rule me.h.games_arcade
on me.small
when hook=games_arcade
- Ever go to the arcade?
- Are you any good at the arcade?

@rule move.h.games_arcade.ask
on move.ask
when hook=games_arcade
- Ask what she wins at the claw machine

@rule react.h.games_arcade.ask
on react
when hook=games_arcade move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A frog plush. I have six. They're a family now.
- Mostly nothing. But once a giant bear. Once.
- Keychains. I give them away to people I like.

@rule move.h.games_arcade.invite
on move.invite
when hook=games_arcade
- Ask her to go after school

@rule react.h.games_arcade.invite
on react
when hook=games_arcade move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Okay! Bring coins. Lots of coins.
- You're on. Prepare to watch a master.
- Fine. But you hold my bag.

@rule move.h.games_arcade.tease
on move.tease
when hook=games_arcade
- Say those machines are rigged

@rule react.h.games_arcade.tease
on react
when hook=games_arcade move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Not for me. I know their secrets.
- That's what losers say.
- Rigged in my favor, maybe.

@rule react.h.games_arcade.bad
on react
when hook=games_arcade fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. You'd be bored.
- I go alone, usually.

# ---------------- season ----------------
@rule small.season.now~state
on small
when subject=season
shape state
hook season_now
opens ask,share,tease
- The seasons change so fast here. I never have the right clothes.
- This time of year makes me want to go somewhere. Anywhere.
- I like this season. Everything smells different in the morning.

@rule small.season.out~state
on small
when subject=season outside=yes weather=clear
shape state
hook season_now
opens ask,share,tease
- Look at the sky today. It's the kind of blue you only get this time of year.
- It's so nice out. It feels wasted on classes.

@rule small.season.birthday~state
on small
when subject=season birthday=week|soon
shape state
hook season_bday
opens ask,tease,invite
- My favorite time of year is coming. Not because of my birthday. ...Okay, a little because of my birthday.
- Did you know my birthday's around now? Not that I'm hinting.

@rule me.h.season_now
on me.small
when hook=season_now
- What's your favorite season?
- Nice time of year, huh?

@rule move.h.season_now.ask
on move.ask
when hook=season_now
- Ask what her favorite season is

@rule react.h.season_now.ask
on react
when hook=season_now move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Autumn. Sweet potatoes and no sweating.
- Spring. Everyone looks happier.
- Winter. I like being cold and then warm.

@rule move.h.season_now.share
on move.share
when hook=season_now
- Say which one you like best

@rule react.h.season_now.share
on react
when hook=season_now move=share fit=good|neutral
- Summer? You're brave. I melt.
- Same! We have good taste.
- Hm. I'll allow it.

@rule move.h.season_now.tease
on move.tease
when hook=season_now
- Say she complains every season

@rule react.h.season_now.tease
on react
when hook=season_now move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I do not! ...I complain about the weather, not the season.
- Every season has its problems. I'm just honest.
- And you'll listen every season. Lucky you.

@rule react.h.season_now.bad
on react
when hook=season_now fit=bad
feel pout
- Seasons are seasons.
- I don't really care either way.

@rule me.h.season_bday
on me.small
when hook=season_bday
- Isn't your birthday coming up?
- What do you want for your birthday?

@rule move.h.season_bday.ask
on move.ask
when hook=season_bday
- Ask what she wants for her birthday

@rule react.h.season_bday.ask
on react
when hook=season_bday move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Surprise me. A good surprise.
- Something sweet. And someone to eat it with.
- I don't need much. Just remember it.

@rule move.h.season_bday.tease
on move.tease
when hook=season_bday
- Pretend you forgot when it is

@rule react.h.season_bday.tease
on react
when hook=season_bday move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You what?! ...You're joking. You're joking, right?
- Cruel. I'm writing it on your hand.
- Then I'll remind you every hour.

@rule move.h.season_bday.invite
on move.invite
when hook=season_bday
- Offer to celebrate it together

@rule react.h.season_bday.invite
on react
when hook=season_bday move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then it's a promise.
- Okay. Cake is mandatory.
- ...That would make it the best one.

@rule react.h.season_bday.bad
on react
when hook=season_bday fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't make a fuss.
- It's not a big deal.

# ---------------- phone ----------------
@rule small.phone.scroll~state
on small
when subject=phone
shape state
hook phone_scroll
opens ask,share,tease
- I spent an hour looking at cat videos last night. I regret nothing.
- My phone says I used it six hours yesterday. My phone is a liar.
- Someone in my class posts photos of every meal. I know her lunch better than mine.

@rule small.phone.bff~state
on small
when subject=phone bff=*
shape state
hook phone_scroll
opens ask,share,tease
- {bff} sends me forty messages a day. I answer three.
- {bff} keeps sending me memes in class. I almost got caught laughing.

@rule small.phone.number~state
on small
when subject=phone rel=acquaintance|friend interest=yes
shape state
hook phone_number
opens ask,admit,tease
- We don't even have each other's numbers, do we? That's weird.
- Everyone's in our class group chat except you. You should join.

@rule me.h.phone_scroll
on me.small
when hook=phone_scroll
- What do you do on your phone all day?
- Anything good online lately?

@rule move.h.phone_scroll.ask
on move.ask
when hook=phone_scroll
- Ask what the best thing she saw was

@rule react.h.phone_scroll.ask
on react
when hook=phone_scroll move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A cat that falls asleep standing up. I watched it fifty times.
- A video of a duck chasing a man. Justice.
- A recipe I'll never make. It looked beautiful.

@rule move.h.phone_scroll.share
on move.share
when hook=phone_scroll
- Show her something funny on your phone

@rule react.h.phone_scroll.share
on react
when hook=phone_scroll move=share fit=good|neutral
- Ha! Send me that. Now.
- Okay, that's actually funny.
- Why is that so funny? I can't stop.

@rule move.h.phone_scroll.tease
on move.tease
when hook=phone_scroll
- Say she should spend less time on it

@rule react.h.phone_scroll.tease
on react
when hook=phone_scroll move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Says the guy who checks his phone every minute.
- You're not my mom. ...Okay, maybe a little less.
- I'll put it down when you're more interesting.

@rule react.h.phone_scroll.bad
on react
when hook=phone_scroll fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't get it.
- Whatever. It's my phone.

@rule me.h.phone_number
on me.small
when hook=phone_number
- Can I have your number?
- Want to swap contacts?

@rule move.h.phone_number.ask
on move.ask
when hook=phone_number
- Ask for her number

@rule react.h.phone_number.ask
on react
when hook=phone_number move=ask fit=good|neutral
- ...Fine. Don't send me anything weird.
- Here. Don't lose it.
- Okay. But I answer when I want.

@rule move.h.phone_number.admit
on move.admit
when hook=phone_number
- Admit you've wanted to ask for a while

@rule react.h.phone_number.admit
on react
when hook=phone_number move=admit fit=good|neutral
- You could've just asked. ...I would've said yes.
- Really? That's kind of cute.
- Then why'd you wait so long?

@rule move.h.phone_number.tease
on move.tease
when hook=phone_number
- Say she's the one who wants yours

@rule react.h.phone_number.tease
on react
when hook=phone_number move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Excuse me? ...Okay, maybe.
- In your dreams. ...Give it to me anyway.
- Confident. Annoying, but confident.

@rule react.h.phone_number.bad
on react
when hook=phone_number fit=bad
feel pout
- Maybe some other time.
- Let's not rush.

# ---------------- parttime ----------------
@rule small.parttime.job~state
on small
when subject=parttime
shape state
hook parttime_job
opens ask,share,tease
- I'm thinking about getting a part-time job. I want my own money.
- My friend works at a café. She gets free cake. I'm so jealous.
- I applied at the bookstore. I'd mostly just read, honestly.

@rule small.parttime.club~state
on small
when subject=parttime hasclub=yes
shape state
hook parttime_job
opens ask,share,tease
- With the {club}, I don't have time for a job. My wallet is crying.
- I'd work a part-time job, but the {club} eats all my evenings.

@rule small.parttime.broke~state
on small
when subject=parttime mood=hungry|bored
shape state
hook parttime_broke
opens ask,comfort,invite
- I'm broke until the end of the month. I'm living on bread crusts.
- I spent all my allowance already. It's only the middle of the month.

@rule me.h.parttime_job
on me.small
when hook=parttime_job
- Do you work anywhere?
- Ever thought about a part-time job?

@rule move.h.parttime_job.ask
on move.ask
when hook=parttime_job
- Ask where she would want to work

@rule react.h.parttime_job.ask
on react
when hook=parttime_job move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Somewhere with a cute uniform. Is that shallow?
- A flower shop. It smells nice all day.
- Anywhere I don't have to talk on the phone.

@rule move.h.parttime_job.share
on move.share
when hook=parttime_job
- Tell her about a job you had or want

@rule react.h.parttime_job.share
on react
when hook=parttime_job move=share fit=good|neutral
- You'd be good at that, actually.
- I can't picture you doing that. I want to see it.
- Then we can complain about bosses together.

@rule move.h.parttime_job.tease
on move.tease
when hook=parttime_job
- Say she'd quit in a week

@rule react.h.parttime_job.tease
on react
when hook=parttime_job move=tease fit=good|neutral
- One week? I'd last at least... ten days.
- Rude. Accurate, maybe, but rude.
- And you'd last three, so.

@rule react.h.parttime_job.bad
on react
when hook=parttime_job fit=bad
feel pout
- Never mind. It's just an idea.
- Let's not talk about money.

@rule me.h.parttime_broke
on me.small
when hook=parttime_broke
- Are you broke too?
- End of the month, huh?

@rule move.h.parttime_broke.ask
on move.ask
when hook=parttime_broke
- Ask what she spent it on

@rule react.h.parttime_broke.ask
on react
when hook=parttime_broke move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Snacks. Mostly snacks. And one very cute pen.
- A concert ticket. Worth it.
- I honestly don't know. It just disappeared.

@rule move.h.parttime_broke.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=parttime_broke
- Say payday is close

@rule react.h.parttime_broke.comfort
on react
when hook=parttime_broke move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Twelve more days. I'm counting.
- Close isn't close enough.
- Thanks. I'll survive on hope.

@rule move.h.parttime_broke.invite
on move.invite
when hook=parttime_broke
- Offer to buy her something to eat

@rule react.h.parttime_broke.invite
on react
when hook=parttime_broke move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really?! You're my hero today.
- I'll pay you back. Probably.
- You don't have to... but I'm not saying no.

@rule react.h.parttime_broke.bad
on react
when hook=parttime_broke fit=bad
feel pout
- I'm fine. Really.
- Don't pity me.

# ---------------- fears ----------------
@rule small.fears.scared~state
on small
when subject=fears
shape state
hook fears_scared
opens ask,share,tease
- I'm scared of the dark hallway by the old gym. Everyone says it's haunted.
- Spiders. I don't care how small. Spiders.
- Thunder. I pretend I'm fine, but I'm not.

@rule small.fears.storm~state
on small
when subject=fears weather=storm
shape state
hook fears_scared
opens ask,share,tease
- I-is it thundering? I'm not scared. I'm just standing near you on purpose.
- I hate storms. The windows rattle and I can't think.

@rule small.fears.serious~state
on small
when subject=fears rel=friend|lover|girlfriend
shape state
hook fears_deep
opens ask,comfort,share
- You know what really scares me? Being forgotten. People just moving on.
- I'm afraid of not knowing what I want to do. Everyone else seems so sure.

@rule me.h.fears_scared
on me.small
when hook=fears_scared
- What scares you?
- Are you scared of anything?

@rule move.h.fears_scared.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fears_scared
- Ask how she deals with it

@rule react.h.fears_scared.ask
on react
when hook=fears_scared move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I run. Very fast.
- I sing loudly. It doesn't help, but it's loud.
- I call someone. Usually my mom. Don't tell anyone.

@rule move.h.fears_scared.share
on move.share
when hook=fears_scared
- Tell her what you're scared of

@rule react.h.fears_scared.share
on react
when hook=fears_scared move=share fit=good|neutral
- You? Scared of that? That's kind of cute.
- Then we'll protect each other.
- Okay, I won't laugh. Much.

@rule move.h.fears_scared.tease
on move.tease
when hook=fears_scared
- Say you could scare her right now

@rule react.h.fears_scared.tease
on react
when hook=fears_scared move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't you dare. I'll scream and they'll blame you.
- Try it and I'll never speak to you again.
- ...You wouldn't. Right?

@rule react.h.fears_scared.bad
on react
when hook=fears_scared fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not funny.
- I don't want to talk about it.

@rule me.h.fears_deep
on me.small
when hook=fears_deep
- What are you really afraid of?
- Does anything ever worry you?

@rule move.h.fears_deep.ask
on move.ask
when hook=fears_deep
- Ask when she started feeling that way

@rule react.h.fears_deep.ask
on react
when hook=fears_deep move=ask fit=good|neutral
- When my best friend moved away. She stopped writing after a month.
- Since this year. Everyone's talking about the future.
- I don't know. It just sits there.

@rule move.h.fears_deep.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=fears_deep
- Say you won't forget her

@rule react.h.fears_deep.comfort
on react
when hook=fears_deep move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- ...You'd better not. I'm holding you to that.
- That's an easy thing to say. But thank you.
- Okay. I believe you. A little.

@rule move.h.fears_deep.share
on move.share
when hook=fears_deep
- Admit you worry about the same thing

@rule react.h.fears_deep.share
on react
when hook=fears_deep move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? I thought it was just me.
- Then we're both a little lost. That's okay.
- Strange. That makes me feel better.

@rule react.h.fears_deep.bad
on react
when hook=fears_deep fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. That got too serious.
- Sorry. That's heavy.

# ---------------- peeves ----------------
@rule small.peeves.annoy~state
on small
when subject=peeves
shape state
hook peeves_annoy
opens ask,agree,tease
- You know what I can't stand? People who walk slowly in the hallway. Three across.
- People who chew loudly in the library. I hear everything.
- When someone says 'calm down.' I was calm until then.

@rule small.peeves.rival~state
on small
when subject=peeves rivalnear=*
shape state
hook peeves_annoy
opens ask,agree,tease
- {rivalnear} is here. Of course. She laughs like a car alarm.
- Can we talk somewhere {rivalnear} can't hear? She gets on my nerves.

@rule small.peeves.upset~state
on small
when subject=peeves mood=upset|stressed
shape state
hook peeves_today
opens ask,comfort,agree
- Everything's annoying me today. The bell, the stairs, the air.
- Someone took my umbrella this morning. Today's ruined.

@rule me.h.peeves_annoy
on me.small
when hook=peeves_annoy
- What annoys you?
- Anything get on your nerves lately?

@rule move.h.peeves_annoy.ask
on move.ask
when hook=peeves_annoy
- Ask what else drives her crazy

@rule react.h.peeves_annoy.ask
on react
when hook=peeves_annoy move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Wet sleeves. Unforgivable.
- When a song gets stuck in my head and I only know one line.
- Group projects. Where one person does everything. Me.

@rule move.h.peeves_annoy.agree
on move.agree
when hook=peeves_annoy
- Say that drives you crazy too

@rule react.h.peeves_annoy.agree
on react
when hook=peeves_annoy move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Right?! Finally, someone understands.
- We should start a club. A very angry club.
- See? I'm not unreasonable.

@rule move.h.peeves_annoy.tease
on move.tease
when hook=peeves_annoy
- Say she's a little picky

@rule react.h.peeves_annoy.tease
on react
when hook=peeves_annoy move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Picky? I have standards.
- ...Maybe. A little. Don't spread it.
- And you're one of the things I put up with.

@rule react.h.peeves_annoy.bad
on react
when hook=peeves_annoy fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it, you don't get it.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.peeves_today
on me.small
when hook=peeves_today
- Rough day?
- Something bugging you?

@rule move.h.peeves_today.ask
on move.ask
when hook=peeves_today
- Ask what started it

@rule react.h.peeves_today.ask
on react
when hook=peeves_today move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I tripped on the stairs in front of everyone.
- My alarm didn't ring. Then everything after that.
- A teacher called me out for something I didn't do.

@rule move.h.peeves_today.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=peeves_today
- Say tomorrow will be better

@rule react.h.peeves_today.comfort
on react
when hook=peeves_today move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It has to be. It can't get worse.
- Promise? I'll hold you to that.
- ...Thanks. That helps a little.

@rule move.h.peeves_today.agree
on move.agree
when hook=peeves_today
- Say some days are just like that

@rule react.h.peeves_today.agree
on react
when hook=peeves_today move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Yeah. This is one of them.
- At least you get it.
- Exactly. Let me be grumpy.

@rule react.h.peeves_today.bad
on react
when hook=peeves_today fit=bad
feel pout
- Just leave me alone for a bit.
- I don't want to talk.

# ---------------- wish ----------------
@rule small.wish.one~state
on small
when subject=wish
shape state
hook wish_one
opens ask,share,tease
- If I could have one wish, I'd wish for a day with no homework. Forever.
- I'd wish to be able to teleport. No more trains in the morning.
- One wish? A house with a big window and a cat in it.

@rule small.wish.star~state
on small
when subject=wish period=after
shape state
hook wish_one
opens ask,share,tease
- When I walk home this late, I look for the first star and make a wish. Silly, right?
- The sky's getting dark. I always wish on the first star.

@rule small.wish.sign~state
on small
when subject=wish sign=*
shape state
hook wish_sign
opens ask,tease,share
- My horoscope says a wish of mine comes true this week. I'm a {sign}, so it must be true.
- As a {sign}, I'm supposed to get what I wish for. Eventually.

@rule me.h.wish_one
on me.small
when hook=wish_one
- If you had one wish, what would it be?
- What would you wish for?

@rule move.h.wish_one.ask
on move.ask
when hook=wish_one
- Ask what she wished for last time

@rule react.h.wish_one.ask
on react
when hook=wish_one move=ask fit=good|neutral
- To pass the math test. It worked. Barely.
- That's a secret. Wishes don't work if you tell.
- For it not to rain on the festival. It rained.

@rule move.h.wish_one.share
on move.share
when hook=wish_one
- Tell her your wish

@rule react.h.wish_one.share
on react
when hook=wish_one move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's sweet. Wait, really?
- Ha, that's so you.
- Okay, I'll wish for that too. Double power.

@rule move.h.wish_one.tease
on move.tease
when hook=wish_one
- Say she'd waste it on food

@rule react.h.wish_one.tease
on react
when hook=wish_one move=tease fit=good|neutral
- ...I'm not saying you're wrong.
- A good wish is a delicious wish.
- Better than whatever you'd wish for.

@rule react.h.wish_one.bad
on react
when hook=wish_one fit=bad
feel pout
- Wishes are silly anyway.
- Forget it.

@rule me.h.wish_sign
on me.small
when hook=wish_sign
- Do you believe in horoscopes?
- What's your sign again?

@rule move.h.wish_sign.ask
on move.ask
when hook=wish_sign
- Ask what her horoscope said exactly

@rule react.h.wish_sign.ask
on react
when hook=wish_sign move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A meeting with someone important. Hm.
- To avoid red today. I'm wearing red socks. I'm doomed.
- Something about luck and patience. Mostly patience.

@rule move.h.wish_sign.tease
on move.tease
when hook=wish_sign
- Say it's all made up

@rule react.h.wish_sign.tease
on react
when hook=wish_sign move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Says the person who reads his anyway.
- Then why does mine keep being right?
- Rude. The stars are listening.

@rule move.h.wish_sign.share
on move.share
when hook=wish_sign
- Tell her your sign

@rule react.h.wish_sign.share
on react
when hook=wish_sign move=share fit=good|neutral
- Hm, that goes well with mine. Supposedly.
- Oh no. That's a dangerous match.
- That explains so much about you.

@rule react.h.wish_sign.bad
on react
when hook=wish_sign fit=bad
feel pout
- You wouldn't understand.
- Never mind.

# ---------------- memory ----------------
@rule small.memory.best~state
on small
when subject=memory
shape state
hook memory_best
opens ask,share,tease
- My best memory here? The first day. I got lost and someone walked me to class.
- Last year's festival. We stayed late and the whole school smelled like takoyaki.
- The day it snowed and nobody could focus. Even the teacher looked out the window.

@rule small.memory.days~state
on small
when subject=memory days=many
shape state
hook memory_us
opens ask,share,admit
- We've talked a lot, haven't we? I remember the first time. You were so awkward.
- Some of my favorite memories this year have you in them. That's weird to say.

@rule small.memory.kclub~state
on small
when subject=memory kclub=yes
shape state
hook memory_best
opens ask,share,tease
- My best memory this year is the club. Even the weird parts. Especially the weird parts.
- Joining the {club} was the best thing I did this year. Don't tell anyone I said that.

@rule me.h.memory_best
on me.small
when hook=memory_best
- What's your best memory here?
- Got a favorite school memory?

@rule move.h.memory_best.ask
on move.ask
when hook=memory_best
- Ask what made it so special

@rule react.h.memory_best.ask
on react
when hook=memory_best move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I don't know. Everyone was happy at the same time.
- It was the first time I felt like I belonged here.
- The food. And the people. Mostly the food.

@rule move.h.memory_best.share
on move.share
when hook=memory_best
- Share your own favorite memory

@rule react.h.memory_best.share
on react
when hook=memory_best move=share fit=good|neutral
- I remember that day too! You were there?
- That's a good one. Better than mine.
- Hm. I'll have to make a better one with you.

@rule move.h.memory_best.tease
on move.tease
when hook=memory_best
- Say she's getting nostalgic like an old lady

@rule react.h.memory_best.tease
on react
when hook=memory_best move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'm allowed! Memories are free.
- An old lady with great memories, thank you.
- ...You're making a bad memory right now.

@rule react.h.memory_best.bad
on react
when hook=memory_best fit=bad
feel pout
- It's not that special.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.memory_us
on me.small
when hook=memory_us
- Do you remember when we first talked?
- We've been talking a lot lately, huh?

@rule move.h.memory_us.ask
on move.ask
when hook=memory_us
- Ask what she remembers about it

@rule react.h.memory_us.ask
on react
when hook=memory_us move=ask fit=good|neutral
- You asked me something dumb, and I laughed. That's all. It stuck.
- You were nervous. Your voice cracked. I liked that.
- I remember thinking you'd never talk to me again.

@rule move.h.memory_us.share
on move.share
when hook=memory_us
- Say you remember it well too

@rule react.h.memory_us.share
on react
when hook=memory_us move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? I thought it was just me.
- Then we both remember it. Good.
- Okay, now I'm embarrassed.

@rule move.h.memory_us.admit
on move.admit
when hook=memory_us
- Admit you were nervous that day

@rule react.h.memory_us.admit
on react
when hook=memory_us move=admit fit=good|neutral
- I knew it! ...It was cute, though.
- You hid it badly.
- Me too. Don't tell.

@rule react.h.memory_us.bad
on react
when hook=memory_us fit=bad
feel pout
- Let's not get sappy.
- Forget it.

# ---------------- commute ----------------
@rule small.commute.train~state
on small
when subject=commute
shape state
hook commute_train
opens ask,share,tease
- My train was so packed this morning I couldn't reach my phone.
- I walk to school. Twenty minutes uphill. Both ways, somehow.
- I take the bus. The driver knows me now. He waves.

@rule small.commute.rain~state
on small
when subject=commute wet=yes rainlover=no
shape state
hook commute_train
opens ask,share,tease
- I walked here in this rain. My shoes are still squishing.
- The bus was late because of the rain. Everyone was wet and grumpy.

@rule small.commute.late~state
on small
when subject=commute energy<=0.35
shape state
hook commute_late
opens ask,tease,comfort
- I almost missed the bell again. I ran from the station. I'm still sweaty.
- I overslept and caught the last train that gets me here on time. Barely.

@rule me.h.commute_train
on me.small
when hook=commute_train
- How do you get to school?
- Long commute?

@rule move.h.commute_train.ask
on move.ask
when hook=commute_train
- Ask what she does on the way

@rule react.h.commute_train.ask
on react
when hook=commute_train move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Music. Loud. It's my only alone time.
- I people-watch. Everyone looks so tired.
- I study. Or pretend to. Mostly I nap.

@rule move.h.commute_train.share
on move.share
when hook=commute_train
- Tell her how you get here

@rule react.h.commute_train.share
on react
when hook=commute_train move=share fit=good|neutral
- Oh, then we take the same line! I've never seen you.
- That sounds easier than mine.
- We should go together sometime.

@rule move.h.commute_train.tease
on move.tease
when hook=commute_train
- Say she must leave at dawn

@rule react.h.commute_train.tease
on react
when hook=commute_train move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Practically. I see the sunrise. It's not romantic.
- Five forty-five. Feel sorry for me.
- You'd never survive it.

@rule react.h.commute_train.bad
on react
when hook=commute_train fit=bad
feel pout
- It's boring.
- Not much to say about it.

@rule me.h.commute_late
on me.small
when hook=commute_late
- Did you oversleep?
- Running late again?

@rule move.h.commute_late.ask
on move.ask
when hook=commute_late
- Ask why she was late

@rule react.h.commute_late.ask
on react
when hook=commute_late move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I pressed snooze. Five times.
- I was up late. Don't ask doing what.
- My cat sat on my alarm. Not my fault.

@rule move.h.commute_late.tease
on move.tease
when hook=commute_late
- Say she'll get detention one day

@rule react.h.commute_late.tease
on react
when hook=commute_late move=tease fit=good|neutral
- One day. Not today.
- Then you'll visit me in detention, right?
- Only if you tell on me.

@rule move.h.commute_late.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=commute_late
- Say at least she made it

@rule react.h.commute_late.comfort
on react
when hook=commute_late move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Barely. But yes.
- Thanks. My lungs disagree.
- I always make it. Somehow.

@rule react.h.commute_late.bad
on react
when hook=commute_late fit=bad
feel pout
- Don't lecture me.
- I know, I know.

# ---------------- travel ----------------
@rule small.travel.go~state
on small
when subject=travel
shape state
hook travel_go
opens ask,share,invite
- I want to go somewhere far. Somewhere with snow and hot springs.
- I've never been on a plane. I want to, but I'm a little scared.
- If I could go anywhere, I'd go to the sea in winter. Nobody's there.

@rule small.travel.exam~state
on small
when subject=travel exam=yes
shape state
hook travel_go
opens ask,share,invite
- After these exams I'm going on a trip. In my head. I'm already packing.
- When the exams are over, I want to go somewhere and do nothing.

@rule small.travel.partner~state
on small
when subject=travel partner=*
shape state
hook travel_pair
opens ask,tease,share
- {partner} and I keep planning a trip. We never actually go.
- {partner} wants to go to the mountains. I want the beach. We're stuck.

@rule me.h.travel_go
on me.small
when hook=travel_go
- Where would you like to travel?
- Been anywhere fun?

@rule move.h.travel_go.ask
on move.ask
when hook=travel_go
- Ask what she would do there

@rule react.h.travel_go.ask
on react
when hook=travel_go move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Eat. Sleep. Walk. Repeat.
- Take pictures of everything. Even the boring stuff.
- Sit in a hot spring until I turn into soup.

@rule move.h.travel_go.share
on move.share
when hook=travel_go
- Tell her where you want to go

@rule react.h.travel_go.share
on react
when hook=travel_go move=share fit=good|neutral
- That sounds amazing. Take me with you.
- Hm, I'd go there too.
- You have good taste. Surprisingly.

@rule move.h.travel_go.invite
on move.invite
when hook=travel_go
- Say you should take a trip together someday

@rule react.h.travel_go.invite
on react
when hook=travel_go move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Someday... I'll remember you said that.
- Only if you plan it. I'm bad at plans.
- Okay. But I get the window seat.

@rule react.h.travel_go.bad
on react
when hook=travel_go fit=bad
feel pout
- I'll never go anywhere anyway.
- It's just a dream.

@rule me.h.travel_pair
on me.small
when hook=travel_pair
- Going on any trips?
- Got plans for the holidays?

@rule move.h.travel_pair.ask
on move.ask
when hook=travel_pair
- Ask where they want to go

@rule react.h.travel_pair.ask
on react
when hook=travel_pair move=ask fit=good|neutral
- She says Kyoto. I say anywhere with good food. So, Kyoto.
- We can't agree. That's half the fun.
- Somewhere neither of us has been.

@rule move.h.travel_pair.tease
on move.tease
when hook=travel_pair
- Say they'll argue the whole trip

@rule react.h.travel_pair.tease
on react
when hook=travel_pair move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Probably. And still have fun.
- That's how we know it's a good trip.
- Don't jinx it.

@rule move.h.travel_pair.share
on move.share
when hook=travel_pair
- Recommend somewhere you went

@rule react.h.travel_pair.share
on react
when hook=travel_pair move=share fit=good|neutral
- Really? I'll tell her. She'll pretend it was her idea.
- That's a good idea. Thanks.
- Hm, maybe we'll try that.

@rule react.h.travel_pair.bad
on react
when hook=travel_pair fit=bad
feel pout
- We'll see.
- Forget it.

# ---------------- classmates ----------------
@rule small.classmates.class~state
on small
when subject=classmates
shape state
hook class_mates
opens ask,share,tease
- Someone in my class brought a fish tank. Just a fish tank. Nobody knows why.
- The boy behind me draws dragons in every notebook. They're getting good.
- Two people in my class are definitely dating and pretending they're not.

@rule small.classmates.bff~state
on small
when subject=classmates bff=*
shape state
hook class_bff
opens ask,share,tease
- {bff} and I sit next to each other. We pass notes like kids.
- Have you met {bff}? She's my best friend. She talks about you, by the way.

@rule small.classmates.fight~state
on small
when subject=classmates fight=yes
shape state
hook class_fight
opens ask,comfort,defend
- Things are weird with {fightwho} right now. Everyone in class can tell.
- {fightwho} won't look at me since we argued. The whole room feels heavy.

@rule me.h.class_mates
on me.small
when hook=class_mates
- How's your class?
- Anyone interesting in your class?

@rule move.h.class_mates.ask
on move.ask
when hook=class_mates
- Ask who she thinks is dating

@rule react.h.class_mates.ask
on react
when hook=class_mates move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I won't name names. ...Okay, one name.
- I'll tell you if you guess right.
- Two by the window. Watch them at lunch. Obvious.

@rule move.h.class_mates.share
on move.share
when hook=class_mates
- Tell her something funny from your class

@rule react.h.class_mates.share
on react
when hook=class_mates move=share fit=good|neutral
- No way. Our classes are both weird.
- Ha! I need to see that.
- Your class sounds more fun than mine.

@rule move.h.class_mates.tease
on move.tease
when hook=class_mates
- Say she's the weird one in her class

@rule react.h.class_mates.tease
on react
when hook=class_mates move=tease fit=good|neutral
- I'm the normal one! Probably.
- Every class needs one. I volunteered.
- ...I'll let that slide. Once.

@rule react.h.class_mates.bad
on react
when hook=class_mates fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't really know them well.
- Never mind.

@rule me.h.class_bff
on me.small
when hook=class_bff
- How's your best friend?
- You two are always together, huh?

@rule move.h.class_bff.ask
on move.ask
when hook=class_bff
- Ask what she says about you

@rule react.h.class_bff.ask
on react
when hook=class_bff move=ask fit=good|neutral
- ...That's classified.
- Only good things. Mostly.
- That you're 'not bad.' High praise, from her.

@rule move.h.class_bff.share
on move.share
when hook=class_bff
- Say she seems really nice

@rule react.h.class_bff.share
on react
when hook=class_bff move=share fit=good|neutral
- She is. Don't steal her.
- She'll be happy to hear that.
- Yeah. She's my favorite person. One of them.

@rule move.h.class_bff.tease
on move.tease
when hook=class_bff
- Say you should ask her about you

@rule react.h.class_bff.tease
on react
when hook=class_bff move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't you dare.
- She'd tell you everything. Please don't.
- You'd regret it.

@rule react.h.class_bff.bad
on react
when hook=class_bff fit=bad
feel pout
- Let's not talk about her behind her back.
- Forget it.

@rule me.h.class_fight
on me.small
when hook=class_fight
- Is everything okay in class?
- Did something happen with your friends?

@rule move.h.class_fight.ask
on move.ask
when hook=class_fight
- Ask what the fight was about

@rule react.h.class_fight.ask
on react
when hook=class_fight move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Something small that got big. As usual.
- I said something I didn't mean. She said something she did.
- I'm not even sure anymore.

@rule move.h.class_fight.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=class_fight
- Say she'll come around

@rule react.h.class_fight.comfort
on react
when hook=class_fight move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- You think so? I hope.
- Maybe. If I say sorry first.
- ...Thanks. I needed to hear that.

@rule move.h.class_fight.defend
on move.defend
when hook=class_fight
- Say it doesn't sound like her fault

@rule react.h.class_fight.defend
on react
when hook=class_fight move=defend fit=good|neutral
- That's nice of you, but it's a little my fault.
- Thanks for taking my side.
- Don't say that to her, though.

@rule react.h.class_fight.bad
on react
when hook=class_fight fit=bad
feel pout
- I don't want to talk about it.
- It's between us.

# ---------------- talent ----------------
@rule small.talent.hidden~state
on small
when subject=talent
shape state
hook talent_hidden
opens ask,share,tease
- I have a secret talent. I can fold paper cranes with my eyes closed.
- I can whistle any song after hearing it once. It's useless, but impressive.
- Don't laugh, but I'm really good at drawing horses. Only horses.

@rule small.talent.tall~state
on small
when subject=talent height=tall
shape state
hook talent_hidden
opens ask,share,tease
- My one talent is reaching the top shelf in the library. Everyone asks me.
- Being tall is my talent, apparently. That's all anyone asks me about.

@rule small.talent.short~state
on small
when subject=talent height=short
shape state
hook talent_hidden
opens ask,share,tease
- I can fit anywhere. Hide and seek champion, five years running.
- Being small is great at concerts. I just slip to the front.

@rule me.h.talent_hidden
on me.small
when hook=talent_hidden
- Got any hidden talents?
- What are you secretly good at?

@rule move.h.talent_hidden.ask
on move.ask
when hook=talent_hidden
- Ask her to show you

@rule react.h.talent_hidden.ask
on react
when hook=talent_hidden move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Not here! ...Okay, a quick one.
- Later. With fewer people watching.
- You have to pay first. In snacks.

@rule move.h.talent_hidden.share
on move.share
when hook=talent_hidden
- Tell her your own weird talent

@rule react.h.talent_hidden.share
on react
when hook=talent_hidden move=share fit=good|neutral
- That's amazing. And very weird.
- Show me right now.
- Okay, yours is better. I'm jealous.

@rule move.h.talent_hidden.tease
on move.tease
when hook=talent_hidden
- Say that's not a real talent

@rule react.h.talent_hidden.tease
on react
when hook=talent_hidden move=tease fit=good|neutral
- It's a real talent! It's just a small one.
- Rude. Do it yourself, then.
- Every talent is real if you believe.

@rule react.h.talent_hidden.bad
on react
when hook=talent_hidden fit=bad
feel pout
- Never mind, it's dumb.
- Forget I said anything.

# ---------------- advice ----------------
@rule small.advice.ask~state
on small
when subject=advice
shape state
hook advice_need
opens ask,share,thank
- You look like you want to ask me something. Go on, I give good advice.
- People come to me with their problems. I don't know why. I'm a mess.
- If you need advice, I'm here. Free of charge. This week only.

@rule small.advice.warm~state
on small
when subject=advice warm>=0.7
shape state
hook advice_need
opens ask,share,thank
- Is something on your mind? You can tell me. I'm a good listener.
- You seem like you're thinking hard about something. Want to talk it out?

@rule small.advice.blunt~state
on small
when subject=advice blunt>=0.6
shape state
hook advice_blunt
opens ask,laugh,thank
- Want advice? Here's my advice: stop overthinking. That's it. You're welcome.
- If you're going to ask me for advice, expect honesty. Brutal honesty.

@rule me.h.advice_need
on me.small
when hook=advice_need
- Can I ask your advice on something?
- You're good at advice, right?

@rule move.h.advice_need.ask
on move.ask
when hook=advice_need
- Ask how to make friends in a new club

@rule react.h.advice_need.ask
on react
when hook=advice_need move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Show up. Then show up again. Then they're stuck with you.
- Bring snacks. Works every time.
- Ask them about themselves. People love that.

@rule move.h.advice_need.share
on move.share
when hook=advice_need
- Tell her something that's been bothering you

@rule react.h.advice_need.share
on react
when hook=advice_need move=share fit=good|neutral
- Hm. I think you already know what to do. You just want someone to say it.
- That's tough. But you're tougher.
- Thank you for telling me. Really.

@rule move.h.advice_need.thank
on move.thank
when hook=advice_need
- Thank her for always listening

@rule react.h.advice_need.thank
on react
when hook=advice_need move=thank fit=good|neutral
- Anytime. I mean it.
- You're welcome. You can listen to me next time.
- Stop, you'll make me blush.

@rule react.h.advice_need.bad
on react
when hook=advice_need fit=bad
feel pout
- Maybe I'm not the right person.
- I don't really know what to say.

@rule me.h.advice_blunt
on me.small
when hook=advice_blunt
- Got any advice for me?
- What would you do in my place?

@rule move.h.advice_blunt.ask
on move.ask
when hook=advice_blunt
- Ask what you should do about exams

@rule react.h.advice_blunt.ask
on react
when hook=advice_blunt move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Study. Shocking, I know.
- Sleep, eat, study. In that order.
- Stop asking me and open a book.

@rule move.h.advice_blunt.laugh
on move.laugh
when hook=advice_blunt
- Laugh and say that was very helpful

@rule react.h.advice_blunt.laugh
on react
when hook=advice_blunt move=laugh fit=good|neutral
- You asked. I delivered.
- I'm always helpful. You're always surprised.
- Next time I'll charge.

@rule move.h.advice_blunt.thank
on move.thank
when hook=advice_blunt
- Thank her for being honest

@rule react.h.advice_blunt.thank
on react
when hook=advice_blunt move=thank fit=good|neutral
- Somebody has to be.
- ...You're welcome. That's rare.
- Don't get used to it.

@rule react.h.advice_blunt.bad
on react
when hook=advice_blunt fit=bad
feel pout
- Then don't ask me.
- Fine. Figure it out yourself.
